  m_text: "Biggest and last update - #4\nAdded 2 new maps\nAnd maybe some other stuff
    idk i forgot...\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBigger
    update - #3       i might not be on time for the game jam deadline...\nAdded
    one new map\nAdded transparent color coded walls\nAdded a first level\nAdded
    some \"story\"\nAdded testing apparatus\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSmall
    update - #2\nAdded a new crosshair that shows the color channel\nAdded sound
    effects to the remote\nAdded a new main menu background, and added the logo\nAdded
    a small text bubble that shows controls\n                       ---- i think
    i can start working on the gameplay now----\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSmall
    update - #1\nAdded Update logs (can be found in settings)\nRemoved color toggling
    from just the corresponding buttons\nAdded a remote to control colors\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
